@startuml
class Movie { id; title; rating; releasedAt }
class Series { id; title; rating; releasedAt }
class MovieStream { id; provider; audio; quality; expiresAt }
class SeriesStream { id; provider; audio; season; episode; expiresAt }
class MovieGenre { id; name }
class SeriesGenre { id; name }
Movie "1" -- "*" MovieStream
Series "1" -- "*" SeriesStream
Movie "*" -- "*" MovieGenre
Series "*" -- "*" SeriesGenre
note bottom
Streams por mídia e provedor;
relações Prisma com cascade nas streams.
end note
@enduml
